    "problems.eyebrow": "01 — Problems we solve",
    "problems.title": "Common business data problems we solve.",
    "problems.lead": "Symptoms vary across companies. The underlying causes are usually the same six. Each is fixable with the right architecture and discipline.",
    "problems.1.t": "Processes are manual and unplanned.",
    "problems.1.d": "End-to-end automation, capacity planning and workflow optimization — replacing ad-hoc operations with structured, repeatable processes that scale.",
    "problems.2.t": "AI projects stay as demos.",
    "problems.2.d": "Production-ready RAG systems, agents and forecasting models with evaluation frameworks that survive past the proof-of-concept stage.",
    "problems.3.t": "Reporting is manual and slow.",
    "problems.3.d": "Automated dashboards, governed KPIs and reliable refresh pipelines that replace month-end Excel marathons with daily, trusted numbers.",
    "problems.4.t": "Data sits in disconnected systems.",
