    "hww.p1.desc": "Every engagement is led by experienced consultants who do the work themselves — not a sales-led handoff to a junior team. The architect who designs your solution is the architect who builds it.",
    "hww.p2.title": "Architecture before implementation.",
    "hww.p2.desc": "The cheapest mistake is the one we never make. We invest in design, governance and decision rationale before code, so implementation is fast and reversible.",
