    "tech.note.desc": "We don't sell tools. Tool choice is a deliverable: a written recommendation tied to your scale, team skill profile, regulatory environment and TCO. If you already have an investment in Microsoft, Databricks or Snowflake, we work with what you have — and only recommend change when the evidence is overwhelming.",
    "team.role": "Founder · Senior Data & AI Solutions Architect",
    "team.bio.1": "Farhod founded FZD Global GmbH to do <strong>senior-led data consulting</strong> the way it should be done — no junior-heavy delivery, no slide-deck handoffs. Every engagement is led by an experienced architect from <strong>discovery through production</strong>.",
    "team.bio.2": "Background: <strong>M.Sc. Computer Science / Information Systems</strong> (Cologne University of Applied Sciences) and B.Sc. Business Informatics (University of Applied Sciences Southwest Germany). Specialized in <strong>Microsoft Fabric, Azure, Power BI</strong> and the broader Microsoft data stack, with deep experience in <strong>healthcare, MedTech, manufacturing, insurance and energy</strong>.",
    "team.bio.3": "Eight years of hands-on delivery: data platform architecture, cloud DWH, IoT analytics, dashboard modernization, AI workflows and Power Platform automation across the DACH region.",
